extraction_notes: |
  - Rifts World Book 12: Psyscape printed 117-120 (cache p118-p121), text
    layer, with printed 118-119 rendered (d[119], d[120]) to check the stat
    block; every number matched the cache once the known digit fault was read
    (!D4xlO = 1D4x10, 3D6xlO = 3D6x10, !D6xlOO = 1D6x100).
  - NPC-HEADED, G.M. DISCRETION: the stat block is headed "Amorph NPC and
    Optional Player Character" and its Player Note says it is a difficult
    character to play, not advised, G.M. discretion. Said again in GM Notes.
  - TAKES NO O.C.C.: the book prints a full R.C.C. package (R.C.C. skills,
    four related plus schedule, five secondary, equipment, money) and names
    no occupation. There is no frontmatter key for "no occupation at all"
    (occ_restrictions.only may not be empty), so it is a restriction line.
  - No men_of_arms line: the class states sdc_base, so no core S.D.C.
    grouping applies (smoke refuses both). S.D.C./HIT POINTS are ONE combined pool,
    printed "Base is P.E. attribute plus 3D6x10. Add an additional 2D6
    S.D.C./hit points per level". Stored whole as hit_points_base, with
    sdc_base 0 so the core 1D6 S.D.C. is not rolled on top of a pool that
    already includes S.D.C. Not M.D.C.: the book gives the Amorph no M.D.C.
    and says it can be hurt by physical, psionic and magical attacks.
  - P.B.: printed "shape changing range of 2 to 24 (to humans, their
    natural form is P.B. 1D4)". Stored as 1d4 (the natural form); the 2-24
    range is in the Ectoplasmic Metamorphosis ability.
  - Spd 2D4+4 is walking and flying.
  - PSIONICS: "Natural psychic creature", M.E. plus 1D4x10 I.S.P., +10 per
    level. Tier stored as major because the book sets save vs psionics at
    12, the major-psionic threshold, although three of the eleven granted
    powers (Psychic Body Field, Telekinetic Force Field, Psychic Omni-Sight)
    are Super powers; they are granted by name, so the tier gates nothing
    about them. "Commune with Spirits" is the catalog row "Commune with
    Spirit". No picks at level 1; two from Sensitive or Physical at levels
    2, 4, 8, 12 and 15 (powers_schedule).
  - Bonuses: +6 save vs horror factor, +6 vs possession. Save vs psionics
    12 is the tier threshold, not a bonus, so not stored as one. +10%
    charm/impress has no bonus key; it is a special_abilities entry.
    Automatic dodge +1 at levels 3, 6, 9 and 12 is bonuses.at_level
    combat.automatic_dodge.
  - SKILLS: Languages two of choice (+15%) -> two Language: Other picks,
    bonus 15. Dance 30+20 = 50. Climb (+10%) -> Climbing 40+10 = 50. Land
    Navigation 36+25 = 61 (per_level 4 as the catalog). Lore: Astral Plane
    (+15%) -> Lore: Astral 26+15 = 41 (per_level 4). Lore: one of choice
    (+10%) -> one pick from the Rifts-system Lore rows other than Astral,
    bonus 10. Hand to Hand: Basic "can not be upgraded" -> hand_to_hand
    costs {}.
  - Related: Medical "First aid and Holistic Medicine only"; Pilot (+5%);
    Rogue (+10%) except Computer Hacking; Technical (+5%) except Computer
    Programming; W.P. Blunt, Knife, Energy Pistol only. Electrical,
    Mechanical, Military, Physical and Wilderness: none, so not listed.
    Secondary: five, "limited as previously indicated", so the same
    categories and only/except without the bonuses.
  - EQUIPMENT: backpack; "satchel or utility belt" stored as the utility
    belt (the catalog''s only satchel is a purse); folding Swiss Army-type
    knife -> swiss-army-knife; lighter -> cigarette-lighter-refillable; 50
    feet (15.2 m) of rope -> lightweight-rope (length not stored); fishing
    tackle -> fishing-line-and-hooks; sleeping roll -> sleeping-bag;
    portable language translator; 1D4 extra E-clips -> e-clip qty 1d4. NOT
    STORED: the FDD player/recorder (no catalog row), one conventional
    weapon of choice and one energy weapon of choice, usually a vibro-blade
    or pistol (unspecified choices). These are in GM Notes.
  - Money: 1D6x100 credits.
  - xp_table is the one the batch brief gives for this class (15 lower
    bounds read off printed 157).
